     "notes": "New all-electric GLA (MMA platform, 800 V). World premiere in Warsaw in 07/2026, German order start 30.07.2026, market launch around 11/2026, price from 48,599 EUR. Hybrid versions follow in early 2027. Length 4565 mm per mobile.de (ADAC says about 4.57 m). ADAC also gives only rounded values: about 1.87 m wide, 1.60 m high, wheelbase about 2.79 m. Exact mm values were not found, so these fields are null. Rear trunk at least 410 l (70 l more than the predecessor per Motor1), up to 1400 l folded. There is also a front trunk (frunk) of 107 l (auto motor und sport). Codename not confirmed."
