     "notes": "Facelift from 07/2023 (ADAC). All petrol engines now have a 48-volt mild-hybrid system (+10 kW/14 PS boost). ADAC lists the GLA 250 4MATIC with 175 kW (238 PS), which apparently includes the boost; the nominal rating is 165 kW/224 PS. Dimensions: ADAC 4412 x 1834 (2020 with mirrors) x 1616, wheelbase 2729. Trunk varies by powertrain: petrol MHEV 425/1420 l, diesel 427/1422 l, AMG 435/1430 l, PHEV 385/1385 l (Motor1). The GLA 200 4MATIC and front-wheel-drive GLA 250 were dropped; the GLA 220 4MATIC was added. Replaced by the third generation (order start 30.07.2026, market launch around 11/2026); hybrid versions of the new GLA follow in early 2027, so H247 may stay on sale until then."
    },
